WEBVTT

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.930
<b>Presented by Doremi-fansubs</b>

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.930
This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:37.570
June 15, 1582 - Omi Province, Azuchi Castle

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.820
We have kept you waiting,

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.490
Oda Nobukatsu-sama.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:46.570
Mitsuhide has left Azuchi.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.260
We have made our way here post-haste.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.010
Hidemitsu has taken his own life at Sakamoto.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:57.970
Mitsuhide has been defeated at Yamazaki.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:00.250
He has been killed.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.820
Good work.

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:03.380
Gamon Masahide.

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:07.520
You shall henceforth defend Azuchi Castle, the symbol of the heavens.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.210
If I may interject,

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:14.720
but that castle does not bear that status any more.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.590
The Times Are Changing

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.290
Akechi has left his mark.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.520
We cannot let this stand,

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:32.560
or lest it be a shame to the deceased lord.

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:45.430
You are right.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:48.110
That is a good point, Soueki-dono.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.240
Only one conclusion.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:54.160
Burn down the main tower.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.710
N-No!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.990
Even if Akechi left his mark...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.940
The deceased lord left us the main tower!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.910
In my opinion,

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:08.370
leaving the main tower intact is to bow down to Akechi.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:13.430
As long as the white tower remains,

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.900
I cannot fully dispose of the guilt in my heart.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.380
Let it return to nothingness.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:23.320
That shall acertain Nobukatsu-sama's reign over all.

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:29.410
I am afraid the weak hearts of the civilians feel the same.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.870
Akechi-sama.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:46.800
Your way of the tea was truly remarkable.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:50.500
When you painted over the main tower to a brilliant white,

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:53.440
you stole my heart for an instant.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:04:00.850
But I cannot let go of my ambitions.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:05.140
I shall paint the heavens with my color.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:09.690
But before then, let me give you my deepest respects.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.810
I wish to grant you a gift of white.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:27.290
Please observe in nirvana.

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:31.990
This is to mark your crimson end.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:59.930
June 20 - Settsu Province, Ibaraki Castle

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.320
Are you all right, Brother?

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:05.970
Do not sweat over this flesh wound.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:10.220
But attacking Kameyama Castle right after our assault on Oyamazaki

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:12.130
does take a toll.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.360
Do not be too hasty.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.900
Even though we are at the crossroads of where the nation is going,

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.080
we must remain calm and alive.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.370
Sasuke-dono.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.490
If anything should happen to me,

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:28.550
I leave the Nakagawa family to you.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:30.280
What are you saying!?

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:34.620
You cannot change my human nature of fighting my battles to the bitter end.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.230
My son is still too young to take over.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.830
I implore you.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:44.790
There will not be any more huge battles.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.670
Shibata Katsuie is still alive, right?

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:53.110
Hashiba controls the nation after killing Mitsuhide.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.630
But Shibata, who is one of Oda's main generals,

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:58.130
will not accept Hashiba so simply.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:00.860
The head has been publicly displayed.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.970
But I cannot acertain whether it be Mitsuhide.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:09.740
Mizuo Katsubei, one of Mitsuhide's retainers, confirmed the body.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.430
I do not think he is wrong.

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:15.260
As for who shall control the nation,

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:17.060
we shall find out at Kiyosu.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.560
If everything is settled quickly, that is for the best.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.370
I cannot tell him.

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.090
I cannot tell him the truth.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:25.880
The one I saw today.

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:29.690
The suspicious man at Honnouji.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:34.370
I am afraid he was the one who killed Nobu...

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:40.160
Hashiba Hideyoshi.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.250
I must not fan the flames of war any more.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:49.900
What comes next is to curry the favor of Hashiba-sama and his various generals.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:55.290
June 27 - Owari Province, Kiyosu Castle

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:08.270
Goodness, I can finally let out a smile after seeing Shibata's beaming face.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:11.810
He could not have dreamt that we would bring you Nobutada-sama's son.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:14.580
Sanpoushi-sama, was it?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:19.900
Nobutada-sama is the destined heir.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.380
It is only natural his son becomes the ruler.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:27.740
Now no one can dare speak up against me.

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:31.390
I am Sanpoushi-sama's guardian, that is why.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.290
Right?

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.720
Long time no see, Hashiba-sama.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:50.130
I do not remember having you come to Kiyosu.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:52.860
I would like to serve you some tea, as gratitude.

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:21.670
Speak up, Sasuke.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.950
I would like you to free Yasuke-dono, the man you captured at Oyamazaki.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.850
I do not know what went over his head,

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:37.150
but he did attack you on the battleground.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:42.780
However, I have been saved by him countless times.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:47.630
I do not wish for money or lordship.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:50.280
I only wish that I am able to repay him.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.540
Please free Yasuke-dono.

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:00.490
I hope you are not plotting to leave me behind for him.

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:01.950
Never.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:02.890
Sasuke.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.380
You may know this already,

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:11.320
but I was the one who killed the lord.

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:15.960
Yasuke said the same thing.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.800
It is the truth, but I will not kill him.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:22.770
I cannot have others thinking I killed him to shut him up.

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:26.810
I need him to be uttering nonsense.

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:30.220
For that purpose, I have to keep him alive and pretend not to know.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.250
But Sasuke.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:39.810
If you happen to spread such utterances yourself,

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:43.180
I cannot simply ignore you.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:47.520
I shall have to shut you up.

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.130
But if you promise to keep quiet,

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.990
and swear to become my retainer,

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.190
I shall let you go along with Yasuke-dono.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:05.960
However,

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:10.030
if my ears ever hear of any such rumor,

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.720
I will kill you in an instant.

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.320
Do you promise me, Sasuke!?

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.390
Hashiba-sama...

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.250
Any such feelings I may have harbored towards you,

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.990
I have now thrown away.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.170
Feelings?

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.270
Call it hard work!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.220
I finally cried.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.080
What a lonesome man.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:26.350
Is that the only way to keep your friends close?

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.440
Use me as you wish, then.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:33.830
Hashiba Hideyoshi-sama.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:39.390
You are the most important man now, after the lord.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:51.420
I have been had by that monkey.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:58.820
I, Shibata Katsuie, am known for his steadfastness.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.960
But even I cannot defeat the changing nation?

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.670
We can not have you become weak now.

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:06.940
If that monkey rules the nation,

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.950
then me choosing the Katsuie family bears no meaning.

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:14.890
You are definitely the lord's youngers sister. Your tongue is sharp.

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:21.070
But that monkey has become a man.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:25.420
I will be happy to hand over the Shiba title.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:30.100
Do not worry, Oichi-dono.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.910
I will exact revenge for the Oda family.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.110
I shall bet my life on it.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.190
In any case, Oichi-dono.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:43.170
There is one thing that the monkey cannot defeat me in.

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:45.860
What is it?

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.640
I am more popular with the ladies.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.320
What are Mother and Father laughing about?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:03.500
The clothes I chose fit you better, Ochacha.

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:05.920
That one is too fancy.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:11.520
You are only 13. You need to look more docile.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.400
No!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.070
I do not want this!

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.170
Nagamatsu, speak for youself! You are all fancy!

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:24.760
I shall only wear fancy clothes!

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:33.770
It will be a disaster if she ever gets to rule.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.350
But that will not happen, probably.

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:43.860
November, 1582 - Yamashiro Province, Yamazaki Castle Taian

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.230
This is...

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:03.140
The tea room Hashiba-sama ordered for Soueki-dono.

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:04.630
The Taian...

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:10.730
It is too small. Way too small.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:13.180
It is like a birdcage.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:21.040
It is so small I find it hard to breathe. And dark.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:25.320
At most, only two tatami in area, including the bed.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:25.320
(About 36 square feet)

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:27.550
Simple walls made of withering wood.

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:33.040
This is the perfection the master seeks?

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:47.910
Oh!

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.770
This darkness...

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:53.140
The windows open in mysterious places,

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.950
only to make the master's movements uniquely fresh.

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:58.800
And this smallness...

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:02.660
Gets rid of all unnecessary thoughts, leaving one with nervousness.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.140
This place is...

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:07.450
Only suitable for those who are prepared.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.780
A place that brings out fear.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.130
Here.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:17.410
I heard you helped out greatly for Nobunaga-sama's funeral at Daitoku Temple.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:20.110
I am touched.

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:23.920
In the place of the mourning Sanpoushi-sama and Hashiba-sama,

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.700
I have a small offering of thanks.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:31.290
You have also accepted my selfishness.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.700
I am eternally grateful.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:39.200
Yasuke-dono situated at Nanban Temple, why is he treated as a guest...

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.890
He want to be the same as the master,

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:46.710
and mourn Nobunaga-sama's passing.

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.350
Whoa! So light!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.420
It is like I am holding on to just water...

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:08.000
I understand now, Master.

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:12.340
You had to burn down Azuchi Castle.

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:15.270
It was a bonfire, a ceremonial burial.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:19.820
Now I feel it here, deep inside me.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:27.400
That is the end of your dreams of Azuchi.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:31.470
And in a short while,

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:34.890
Hashiba-sama gains control of the nation.

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:39.360
The world is coming to imperfection. I feel it.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:45.150
I finally understand the beauty of the black teacup.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.090
You have rid it of its exterior beauty.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.720
You leave only its use, the display of the tea.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.340
As expected of Furuta-sama.

00:16:55.710 --> 00:17:01.720
I have replicated the goings of the nation inside this very Taian.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.700
I want it to guide the citizenry.

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:08.700
I wonder if that will happen.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:14.440
All the way to Nanban,

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:18.020
not a single person aims to be small.

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:25.250
I was a poor fishmonger before becoming a master of tea. I know.

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:28.440
One day, the entire nation will understand.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:32.990
Yes...

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.650
Let us grant this beauty a name.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.790
Simplicity.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:44.650
Simplicity?

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:24.050
Hashiba killed Nobu.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:29.880
Were you secretly behind all of this?

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.250
I have returned Nobu's favor.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:50.640
I have nothing to do with this nation anymore.

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:56.470
Pardon me.

00:18:57.220 --> 00:19:00.500
I could not control my joy and my hands shook.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.780
If you return to your country,

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:07.580
please tell others what happened tonight.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:13.270
Tell others without ambition nor the hope of fame.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:18.440
Just someone at the Taian serving you.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:23.880
The beauty I have strived for my entire life is finally complete.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:51.230
This dark and imperfect planet.

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:55.020
Right here, it is born.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:19.360
The ones that can excite me with vigor...

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:21.230
are these four.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.890
But how mysterious.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.990
In my collection,

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:33.150
this one was ranked close to nothing.

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:37.410
Now it is even more than the Grand Chancellor's greatest.

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:42.690
These connecting lines, so full of simplicity.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:45.430
Compared to that...

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:49.930
How embarrassing.

00:20:53.740 --> 00:20:57.210
My past self who aimed only for the exterior...

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.760
This may be shaming my passed lord,

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:02.690
but the shame is just terrible.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:07.390
Simplicity and imperfection sure are nice.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:13.060
There is no need to waste money and no need to aim for fame.

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:18.190
No need to become a burden for your family. I have gathered many goods of virtue.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:28.560
I am feeling embarrassed all over!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.320
Who can I give that to?

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:33.290
Nagamatsu-dono? No way!

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:35.090
How about Takayama-dono?

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:36.820
No... I can not give it away or sell it.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.830
I will reveal my own weakness!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.250
Well then, I shall...

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:49.300
Osen.

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:51.700
Thank you for all you have done.

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:56.760
From now on, I will weigh my own worth.

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:35.960
I am sure one day, Sasuke-dono,

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:41.430
you will become worthy of this fabulous container.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:06.590
Everytime I　

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:06.590
Anata no mune

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:08.980
feel your heart

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:08.980
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:15.070
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:15.070
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:21.250
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:21.250
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:27.410
Opppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:27.410
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:33.500
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:33.500
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.500 --> 00:23:37.380
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.500 --> 00:23:37.380
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.610 --> 00:23:40.960
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.610 --> 00:23:40.960
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:46.830
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:46.830
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.930 --> 00:23:49.830
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.930 --> 00:23:49.830
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.910 --> 00:23:52.440
Without each other.

00:23:49.910 --> 00:23:52.440
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:53.400
You should

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:53.400
Soshite

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:58.900
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:58.900
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:02.690
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:02.690
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:08.400
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:08.400
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:14.890
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:14.890
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:20.690
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:20.690
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.170 --> 00:24:26.670
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.170 --> 00:24:26.670
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.220 --> 00:24:36.870
Whoosh.

00:24:41.830 --> 00:24:43.440
Hey! Restrain yourself!!

